3.0.10 (or any previous version) does not support color terminals on BSD
varients (SunOS is a bsd varient).  Defining TERMINFO only helps you if
you have System V.  You can hack termcap.c to get support on an ANSI
based terminal/emulator (like Weinstein's) under BSD.  If I remember
correctly, a fake #undef UNIX at the right place will do it.

Future versions of nethack will support ANSI color on BSD.  They may
support other color terminals.

